  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.4 — Fix package detail pricing dropping out on consumer sites: `mt_packages.packageprices` was a getter-only computed property backed by the `[JsonIgnore]` `mt_packagePrices` collection, so after a JSON round-trip (apiConnector deserialize → cshtml re-serialize) the getter reset it to an empty list and the price sidebar never rendered. Added a setter and stopped the getter from wiping deserialized values when the EF collection is empty. Server/API behaviour unchanged. 1.0.3 — Rebuilt against net3000.common 10.0.21 (assembly `common`). The published 1.0.2 referenced the old `net3000.common` assembly (renamed to `common` in 10.0.21), causing FileNotFoundException in consumers. No API changes. 1.0.2 — Stop leaking the legacy net3000 monolith as a package dependency: the internal netlibCore reference is now PrivateAssets=\"all\", so the published package no longer carries the stale \"net3000 2.0.0\" dependency that duplicated the almotawif/content types and broke consumer builds with CS0433. 1.0.1 — Fix package dependency id: depend on net3000.twilio (TwilioService project's PackageId) instead of the project name \"TwilioService\", which had no published package and broke restore (NU1101) in consumer sites. 1.0.0 — Initial release with travel booking, package management, and reservation features.",
